### documentos assinados
!/all-docs/clientes/*/*assinado*.pdf
!/all-docs/clientes/*/*assinado*.docx

!*assinado*.pdf
!/*/*assinado*.pdf
!/*/*/*assinado*.pdf
!*_assinado*.pdf
!*_assinado*.docx
!*-assinado*.pdf
!*-assinado*.docx
!*.assinado*.pdf
!*.assinado*.docx

### CV
!/all-docs/*/documentos/curriculum/*/*.pdf
# !all-docs/*/documentos/curriculum/Tech-Lead/CV*.pdf
# !all-docs/*/documentos/curriculum/Developer/CV*.pdf

### Exception for ignored type of files

!all-docs/pessoais/docs-e-tutoriais/**/*.pdf
!all-docs/pessoais/docs-e-tutoriais/**/*.docx
!all-docs/pessoais/docs-e-tutoriais/**/*.docx

### FINAL DO GITIGNORE

##### KEEP FILES
!.gitkeep
!**/.gitkeep
!**/**/.gitkeep
!*gitkeep*
*git-keep*
!*keep-it*
*nohup*.out*
!*keepit*
*commit-it*
*commitit*

#### FINAL IGNOREFILES
*git-ignore*
*no*commit*
*No*Commit*
*NO*COMMIT*
